--  250228  SSIVLK  AD-14847, added iscertified condition
--  100225  SRLALK  AD-16828, Modified AddPartsOKCommand and PartsInfoAssistantStructure to align with CmsWarningVirtual
--  251124  OSNALK  AD-15406, Change GetAssyPosition function by adding AssmblConfigSlotPosId, added a elseif statement to plsql query.
--  301024  WEDILK  AD-15053, Change Client, Projection, plsvc, plsvt, fragments according to JtTask state diagrammama entiti
--  240827  DUWJLK  AD-13911, Added if block to check the incompatibility of part and aircraft assembly when enter the barcode.
--  240607  DUWJLK  AD-13216, Removed the RemovalReasonCode mandatory behavoir in the add part assitant.
--  240603  MAILLK  AD-12720, Added RemovalReasonCode to the add part assistant.
--  240301  PSUALK  AD-12718, Install Removal toggel in Part Requirment
--  240320  rafalk  AD-12493, Update ludependencies of AddFaultParts action
--  240301  majslk  AD-12350, Modified code to support Manadatory Config slot of MX publish parts
--  240208  majslk  AD-11481, Ludependencies updated in AddFaultParts, AddTaskParts methods
--  240104  majslk  AD-10938, Implemented surfacing is mandatory config slot in add and view parts
--  221122  SUPKLK  AD-8948, Restricted AddPartCommand to MM_MAINT_OPERATIONS_CONTROLLER role
--  221101  LAHNLK  AD-8655, Removed Request part feature related source code
--  220816  VAALLK  AD-8487, Validated the part quantity to be 1 for non-batch parts in the AddPartsPartDetailGroup
--  220728  SPATLK  AD-7819, Added check for hide Add Parts considering task and fault status.
--  220726  DILDLK  AD-8056, Added AddTaskPartsCommand, AddTaskParts action
